role: compile.extract
response_format: json_object
---

Analyse the source text and extract structured information.

For each entity, include its name, type (e.g. Person, Organization, Product, Standard, Location, Term), and a one-sentence context explaining its role.

For each concept, provide its name, a 1–2 sentence definition, and its importance.

For each finding, state the claim in one sentence with an evidence_qualifier (section, page, timestamp, or other reference).

Tags should be 5–10 short lowercase topic tags.

The summary should be a 2–4 sentence overview of the content.

If the source text is a bot-challenge, CAPTCHA, or consists primarily of parsing artifacts without substantive content, return all lists empty and an empty summary.
